                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Inserm – Maladies inflammatoires chroniques de l’intestin (MICI) - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inserm.fr/dossier/maladies-inflammatoires-chroniques-intestin-mici/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.inserm.fr/dossier/maladies-inflammatoires-chroniques-intestin-mici/&lt;/a>&lt;/u> - consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Crohn’s &amp;amp; Colitis Foundation - The facts about inflammatory bowel diseases - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crohnscolitisfoundation.org/sites/default/files/2019-02/Updated%20IBD%20Factbook.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.crohnscolitisfoundation.org/sites/default/files/2019-02/Updated%20IBD%20Factbook.pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/u> – consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>SFNGE - Maladie de Crohn - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.snfge.org/content/maladie-de-crohn-0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.snfge.org/content/maladie-de-crohn-0&lt;/a>&lt;/u> – consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Mayo Clinic - Crohn’s disease. Symptoms and causes - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/crohns-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20353304&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/crohns-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20353304&lt;/a>&lt;/u> - consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Access Economics Pty Limited - The Economic Costs of Crohn’s Disease and Ulcerative Colitis - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://crohnsandcolitis.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Deloitte-Access-Economics-Report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://crohnsandcolitis.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Deloitte-Access-Economics-Report.pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/u> - consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Lönnfors S., et al. IBD and health-related quality of life – discovering the true impact. J Crohns Colitis.2014 Sep;8(10):1281-6. doi: 10.1016/j.crohns.2014.03.005.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>AFA Crohn RCH France - Enquête Regards Croisés sur les MICI - &lt;u>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.calameo.com/read/004080022570a601e74f8?authid=jjmcvG2cjL4f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.calameo.com/read/004080022570a601e74f8?authid=jjmcvG2cjL4f&lt;/a>&lt;/u> – consulté le 23/04/2024&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;p>Turner D., et al. STRIDE-II: An Update on the Selecting Therapeutic Targets in Inflammatory Bowel Disease (STRIDE) Initiative of the International Organization for the Study of IBD (IOIBD): Determining Therapeutic Goals for Treat-to-Target strategies in IBD. Gastroenterology, S0016-5085(20)35572-4., doi:10.1053/j.gastro.2020.12.031.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;"
